# VHBuild.com: A Web-Based System for Managing Knowledge in Projects.

**Authors:** Li, Heng, Tang, Sandy, Man, K. F., Love, Peter E. D.

## Abstract
Describes an intelligent Web-based construction project management system called VHBuild.com which integrates project management, knowledge management, and artificial intelligence technologies. Highlights include an information flow model; time-cost optimization based on genetic algorithms; rule-based drawing interpretation; and a case-based reasoning approach. (Author/LRW)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ659705

